  "question": {
    "text": "The Plot of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math>-metric titration of weak base <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi></math> vs strong acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math> looks like",
